  "id": "pasta-salad",
  "name": "Pasta Salad",
  "subtitle": "A colorful chilled salad with seasoned Italian dressing",
  "description": "Cooked spiral pasta is tossed with peppers, tomatoes, olives, and a savory dressing, then chilled before serving.",
